{"steam_appid":3846580,"steam_name":"Lost in Tandem","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3846580/399737747/49964f449dd88cfe77f702ef50b9de893dc5e6b7/1779983620/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1779984846","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257345078/7cbc123b732503656f6781596a70d00b3440e291/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1779984846","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/0930e375f8fb3125fb2da999b004624a19afd138/ss_0930e375f8fb3125fb2da999b004624a19afd138.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784802650","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/8f1956fec1ecd28f37e27aed2f95c339447074bd/ss_8f1956fec1ecd28f37e27aed2f95c339447074bd.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784802650","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/d81118b98cb1a3450794a4a825392220500c6c6d/ss_d81118b98cb1a3450794a4a825392220500c6c6d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784802650","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/645786ce8477cf50faa4ab2eef692a9adf5e7f4a/ss_645786ce8477cf50faa4ab2eef692a9adf5e7f4a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784802650","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/8d3e19dd223f1051176faf7f773b57b22bc0a2bd/ss_8d3e19dd223f1051176faf7f773b57b22bc0a2bd.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784802650"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Lost In Tandem </i>is a colorful, relaxed-paced, 2D adventure-puzzle game, which can be played by one to two players via couch co-op.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/d6ec91111e14301d37b2aeb1943be0ad.poster.avif?t=1784802650\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/d6ec91111e14301d37b2aeb1943be0ad.webm?t=1784802650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Earth Heals after Devastation Strikes</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of the '90s, a cataclysm marks the end of the world as we know it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over numerous decades of humanity's absence, the Earth slowly recovers as nature finally reclaims its rights.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Embark on an Epic Journey</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this post-apocalyptic world, a solitary young girl stumbles upon an obsolete and defective robot known as a <i>Mech-ute</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, they embark on a journey guided by the sole information still programmed in the Mech-ute's deteriorated system: a set of geographic coordinates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/9b0d6abdf0e1ed339266442e1088656d.poster.avif?t=1784802650\" aria-label=\"A gif showcasing a diverse panel of locations\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/9b0d6abdf0e1ed339266442e1088656d.webm?t=1784802650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/9b0d6abdf0e1ed339266442e1088656d.mp4?t=1784802650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Overcome Obstacles Together</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our duo will have to team up to face various challenges to reach their destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They will brave the elements, explore lush colorful landscapes, uncover relics from the turn of the 21st century and encounter a handful of peculiar individuals along the way. Throughout their quest, our duo's relationship will flourish in this heartfelt story that promotes one of the most precious things of all: <i><strong>hope</strong></i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The remaining question is... what will they discover at the end of their journey?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/c9a0f60a64d1d534eb79624fceb333d9.poster.avif?t=1784802650\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/c9a0f60a64d1d534eb79624fceb333d9.webm?t=1784802650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/c9a0f60a64d1d534eb79624fceb333d9.mp4?t=1784802650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/8b7b61047c4022f95c8f83bf0bb34cf7.avif?t=1784802650\" alt=\"Main features\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras_big/8b7b61047c4022f95c8f83bf0bb34cf7.avif?t=1784802650 width=800 height=106 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging asymmetrical co-op gameplay —</strong> Control two vastly different characters to reach your destination.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A unique hybrid form —</strong> Through the young girl, pilot the Mech-ute to unlock new abilities and create a unique cooperative experience.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special Abilities —</strong> Upgrade your Mech-ute to help you out of any predicament.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Activate your Abilities</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/d57bd5c94e07098372c1a74237ea8a04.poster.avif?t=1784802650\" aria-label=\"A gif showcasing a character&#039;s powers\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/d57bd5c94e07098372c1a74237ea8a04.webm?t=1784802650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/d57bd5c94e07098372c1a74237ea8a04.mp4?t=1784802650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Interact with the Environment</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/edcb29e58852bbf153a242d32abf94ea.poster.avif?t=1784802650\" aria-label=\"A gif showcasing different possible interactions\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/edcb29e58852bbf153a242d32abf94ea.webm?t=1784802650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/edcb29e58852bbf153a242d32abf94ea.mp4?t=1784802650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Collect Lore</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/b3e5861e415eb26a1bab3707fe83e704.poster.avif?t=1784802650\" aria-label=\"A gif showcasing various lore elements to collect\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/b3e5861e415eb26a1bab3707fe83e704.webm?t=1784802650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/b3e5861e415eb26a1bab3707fe83e704.mp4?t=1784802650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Meet Cute Robots</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/b9ea650f9e181f20621489fb834c1e3a.webp?t=1784802650\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/b9ea650f9e181f20621489fb834c1e3a.poster.avif?t=1784802650\" class=\"bb_img\" alt=\"\"width=600 height=200 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/cc34976247817af0dc22dcae887e367d.avif?t=1784802650\" alt=\"About the team\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras_big/cc34976247817af0dc22dcae887e367d.avif?t=1784802650 width=800 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are <strong>Tempete Studio,</strong> a small independent video game studio located in Poitiers, France. Our goal is to bring joy to people through our games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We previously collaborated with <i>Libellud</i> on <i><strong>Dixit World</strong></i>, the mobile adaptation of the popular board game <i>Dixit</i>. Building on this experience, we set out to develop our first original game. We wanted to tell a heartfelt story about a little girl and a big robot centered around hope and friendship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras/1aaddbb8e7f49b308f974a62f701cb44.avif?t=1784802650\" alt=\"Wishlist today and follow for updates\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846580/extras_big/1aaddbb8e7f49b308f974a62f701cb44.avif?t=1784802650 width=800 height=293 /></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 660<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure","Casual","Indie"],"developers":["Tempete Studio"],"publishers":["Juicebox Studios"],"release_date":"Jul 22, 2026"}